/* if only one value for margin it defines all four sides

            if two values for margin, the first value defines the top 
            and bottom margins, and the second value defines the left 
            and right margins

            if three values for margin, the first value defines the 
            top margin, the second value defines the left and right 
            margins, and the third value defines the bottom margin 

            if four values for margin, the first value defines the top margin, the 
            second value defines the right margin, the third 
            value defines the bottom margin, and the fourth value defines the 
            left margin
            */